    "id": "story.page.text17",
    "page": "story",
    "section": "split-scene",
    "label": "Paragraph",
    "kind": "text",
    "default": "The East Village proposal describes 500 sq ft plus a basement, with base rent of $6,000 per month. The actual premises must determine the offer, capacity and complete opening budget.",
    "multiline": true
  },
  {
    "id": "story.page.text18",
    "page": "story",
    "section": "split-scene",
    "label": "Text",
    "kind": "text",
    "default": "Other modelling assumes 900–1,200 sq ft and 35–45 seats. The proposed $72k annual rent has not been reconciled with $216k annual model occupancy: a $144k difference. Lease, usable area, permissions, capacity and full occupancy costs require confirmation.",
    "multiline": true
  },
  {
    "id": "story.page.text19",
    "page": "story",
    "section": "split-scene",
    "label": "Button text",
    "kind": "text",
