    "page": "story",
    "section": "growth-section gold-section",
    "label": "Text",
    "kind": "text",
    "default": "Three sites at $1.2–1.5m annual sales each imply $3.6–4.5m combined revenue. This is an illustration without a validated timetable or profitability assumption. Funding terms, benefits and investor rights remain to be agreed.",
