    "section": "Source scenarios",
    "label": "Paragraph",
    "kind": "text",
    "default": "All cases use $268k annual payroll. Occupancy is $216k / $219k / $222k in 2026 / 2027 / 2028. Other opex = gross profit − payroll − occupancy − EBITDA. Below-EBITDA deductions = EBITDA − net profit. These residuals have not been itemised.",
    "multiline": true
  },
  {
    "id": "numbers.page.text32",
    "page": "numbers",
    "section": "Source scenarios",
    "label": "Paragraph",
    "kind": "text",
    "default": "Implied gross margins range from 69.83% to 70.31%. The rounded base 2026 gross profit of $583k differs from the detailed $583.1k illustration only by rounding. Downside remains loss-making in each year. Source net profit is not a verified cash return.",
    "multiline": true
  },
